<description>Tactile push button 6 x 6 mm, through-hole, 4 legs. Store location: kit. Generated by scripts/library_build.py from part.json; do not edit.</description>
<packages>
<package name="TACT_SWITCH_6X6">
<description>pads 1 and 2 are the two legs on one side (4.5 mm apart, the switch); 3 and 4 the legs on the other side, 6.5 mm across. Pin 1 is pads 1 and 3 (joined inside), pin 2 is pads 2 and 4. Drill 1.0 mm, the usual hole for these legs</description>
